 in more countries, TOP 1 - in Japan, Russia, Taiwan, China.", "bundleId": "com.colibrigames.thetinybangstoryhd", "minimumOsVersion": "12.0", "sellerUrl": "http://www.colibrigames.com/", "averageUserRating": 4.75758, "trackCensoredName": "The Tiny Bang Story", "languageCodesISO2A": ["NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "IT", "JA", "RU", "ZH", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes": "126272512", "formattedPrice": "￦7,700", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 33, "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/the-tiny-bang-story/id495937600?uo=4", "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 4.75758, "primaryGenreName": "Games", "primaryGenreId": 6014, "releaseDate": "2012-02-09T15:34:27Z", "trackName": "The Tiny Bang Story", "trackId": 495937600, "userRatingCount": 33}]}